add_body(doc,'I also acknowledge the documentation and open learning resources for Git, GitHub, React, Express, PostgreSQL, Prisma, Redis, BullMQ, Docker, and the security tools discussed in this report. These resources have helped shape the technical decisions and the understanding of version control, API design, authentication, data modeling, asynchronous processing, and secure software development.')
